          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP324 Ponoka [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By the coordinates, it looks like BCP025 Ponoka may be located directly under a large John Deere combine at present. After circling there for a bit I gave up and visited this one. Fun to see it so close to another benchmark, and a quick find once I looked up from digging in the hole…&lt;/p&gt;

